# AnimalCo

AnimalCo is the livestock and animal products store in Farming and Friends.

## 🐄 What is AnimalCo?

AnimalCo is used to buy animals and animal-related supplies. Players can buy:

- Chickens
- Cows
- Sheep
- Bees
- Animal Food
- Shears
- Other animal supplies

Animal products can also be sold at the animal-product selling area outside AnimalCo.

## 📍 Location

AnimalCo is located in the central commercial district of the 2026 map.

It is near:

- FarmCo
- LumberCo
- The central roundabout

## 🐔 Animals

### Chicken
Chickens produce eggs.

### Cow
Cows produce milk, which can be used in milk-related factories such as the Chocolate Milk Factory.

### Sheep
Sheep produce wool. Wool can be sheared and processed into Wool Bundles.

### Bee
Bees produce honey through beehives.

## 🥩 Animal Products

AnimalCo is used for selling animal products such as:

- Eggs
- Milk
- Wool Bundles
- Honey

The animal-product selling area is separate from the crop-selling chutes at FarmCo.

## 🛒 Animal Supplies

AnimalCo also provides supplies needed for animal farming, including:

- Animal Food
- Shears
- Animal-related equipment

Animal Food is needed to keep animals producing their products.

## 🚚 Buying Animals

To buy animals, bring a suitable animal trailer to the marked purchase area at AnimalCo.

Place the trailer in the marked area and use the AnimalCo purchase interface to select the animals you want.
